tree-sitter-php
------------------------------------------
PHP grammar for tree-sitter

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libtree-sitter-php-devel-0.25.1-1bl1
  libtree-sitter-php15.0-0.25.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-php

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-php/archive/refs/tags/v0.25.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack tree-sitter-php-0.25.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./tree-sitter-php-0.25.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/tree-sitter-php-0.25.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/tree-sitter-php-0.25.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtree-sitter-php15.0-0.25.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtree-sitter-php-devel-0.25.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(tree-sitter-php)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/tree-sitter-php.README
  /usr/share/doc/tree-sitter-php/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/tree-sitter-php/README.md

(libtree-sitter-php15.0)
  /usr/bin/cygtree-sitter-php-15.0.dll
  /usr/bin/cygtree-sitter-php_only-15.0.dll

(libtree-sitter-php-devel)
  /usr/include/tree_sitter/tree-sitter-php.h
  /usr/include/tree_sitter/tree-sitter-php_only.h
  /usr/lib/libtree-sitter-php.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libtree-sitter-php_only.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/tree-sitter-php.pc
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/tree-sitter-php_only.pc

